repository-code: "https://github.com/yourusername/broadcast-honeypot-methodology"
abstract: >
  Deployment methodology for a live SSH/Telnet honeypot operating on an isolated VLAN within a production IP-based broadcast infrastructure in Lebanon. Documents network topology constraints, regional ISP limitations, data schema design, and preliminary behavioral observations.
keywords: [cybersecurity, honeypot, cyber deception, broadcast infrastructure, Lebanon, ATT&CK mapping, operational constraints]
